DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260616
DTSTAMP:20260615T000000Z
SUMMARY:Unearth A Story: Teen Creative Writing Contest
DESCRIPTION:Unearth a Story is about finding something that is hidden away. 
 Whether it’s a secret from the past\, a long-forgotten place\, a family 
 story\, or even something inspired by yourself. This summer\, teens are 
 invited to enter the Unearth a Story: Teen Creative Writing Contest! All 
 you have to do is submit a piece of fiction that follows the guidelines 
 below. Your piece can be stopped in magical realism\, or it can be 
 something that’s funny or emotional. It’s all up to you to unearth your 
 story!  \n\nThe first-place winner will be published on the Durham County 
 Library website!\n\nWriting Contest rules: \n\n\n	\n	Short 
 Story\n	\n	\n	Any genre accepted \n	\n	\n	1700 words or less 
 \n	\n\n\nSubmission guidelines: \n\n\n	\n	Open to teens ages 13–17. 
 \n	\n\n\n\n	\n	One submission per participant. \n	\n\n\n\n	\n	Original\, 
 unpublished work only. \n	\n\n\n\n	\n	Submit as a PDF or Word document. 
 \n	\n\n\n\n	\n	Include: \n	\n\n\n\n	\n	Title \n	\n\n\n\n	\n	Author name 
 \n	\n\n\n\n	\n	Age \n	\n\n\n\n	\n	Contact information \n	\n\n\nSubmissions 
 accepted via: \n\n\n	\n	Email: dahbullock@dconc.gov \n	\n\n\n\n	\n	Subject 
 line should state: Teen Creative Writing Contest Submission \n	\n\n\n
LOCATION:Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Dahlia Bullock":MAILTO:dahbullock@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Summer Reading, Writing
UID:LibCal-14288-16636749
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16636749
END:VEVENT
