SUMMARY:Preschool STEAM Storytime: Let's Learn About Dinosaurs!
DESCRIPTION:Preschoolers (ages 3-5 years) and their caregivers are welcome 
 to join Ms. Natalie for a STEAM (Science\, Technology\, Engineering\, 
 Arts\, and Mathematics) storytime! On the 1st and 3rd Monday of every 
 month\, we will explore a different STEAM topic with stories\, songs\, and 
 a hands-on activity.\n\nThis week\, we will learn all about dinosaurs and 
 create our own standing dinosaurs using cardstock paper\, clothespins\, 
 googly eyes\, and paper plates!\n\nRegistration is required.\n\nIf you have 
 any questions\, please contact us @ 919-560-8592.
