SUMMARY:Stone Stories: Create your own Petroglyphs
DESCRIPTION:Explore the world of ancient rock art!\n\nIn this hands-on 
 activity\, you’ll learn about petroglyphs\, stone carvings used by early 
 cultures to tell stories and communicate with symbols.\n\nThen\, create 
 your own using air dry clay\, wooden tools\, and paint. Unleash your 
 creativity and carve your personal story into “stone.”\n\nPlease 
 register to guarantee your supplies.
