SUMMARY:Adult Vision Boards!
DESCRIPTION:\na {\n    text-decoration: none\;\n    color: #464feb\;\n}\ntr 
 th\, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\;\n}\ntr th {\n    
 background-color: #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\n\n\nNow that we're almost halfway through 
 2026\, this an ideal moment to pause\, reflect\, and realign with your 
 goals. Join us for a midyear vision board workshop designed to help you 
 refresh your personal\, professional\, and creative aspirations for the 
 rest of the year.\n\nWhether you’re exploring new career directions\, 
 planning business growth\, or simply wanting to reconnect with your 
 personal goals\, this workshop gives you a space to visualize what comes 
 next. We’ll provide magazines\, markers\, glue\, scissors\, and poster 
 boards\, and you’re welcome to bring any photos\, quotes\, or materials 
 that give you inspiration. \n\nCelebrate your progress\, adjust your path\, 
 or spark new ideas as you craft a visual guide for the months ahead. Come 
 for the reflection and creativity\, stay for the supportive and 
 motivational atmosphere. Let’s set the stage for a strong and intentional 
 second half of 2026!
LOCATION:Meeting Room #4347\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Austin Daniels":MAILTO:ausdaniels@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Arts & Crafts, Career Development
UID:LibCal-14288-16789588
URL:https://durhamcountylibrary.libcal.com/event/16789588
END:VEVENT
