SUMMARY:Tabletop Troupe - Board Games\, Card Games\, & TTRPGs
DESCRIPTION:Welcome to Tabletop Troupe!\n\nThis is a club for ages 7-14 who 
 like all things board games\, card games\, and TTRPGs.\n\nEach meeting\, 
 we'll be learning how to play a new game\, and we will have open games for 
 anyone to walk in and play.\n\nThis June\, we'll be focusing on learning 
 the board game Wingspan!\n\nRegistration is optional.\n\nFeedback Form\n\n 
 \n\nThis program is made possible by a donation from the Friends of the 
 Durham Library. \n\nNew games were purchased through Guildhall Games\, a 
 local game & toy store in Boxyard RTP committed to providing a safe and 
 welcoming space for underrepresented communities in the area.\n
