SUMMARY:Meet Artie 3000 @ Forest Hills Park
DESCRIPTION:Join Ms. Patty and Ms. Sara if your curious about drawing and 
 coding then. Together we will explore\, play and introduce you to Artie 
 3000 at the Forest Hills Park. (located at 1639 University Drive Durham\, 
 NC 27707)\n\nOur library-on-wheels serves local neighborhoods\, shopping 
 centers\, and other community locations. We're open to all so check out our 
 schedule to visit any of our many stops throughout Durham County. We have 
 titles for children\, teens\, and adults\, in both English and Spanish. See 
 our full bookmobile schedule here. \n\n*This schedule is subject to change 
