DTEND:20260623T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260623T000000Z
SUMMARY:So You Want to Be a Published Writer?
DESCRIPTION:\nJoin author and poet Khalisa Rae in her Inspired Writer 
 Series with Durham County Library!\n\n\n\n\n\n\n \n\n\n\n\na {\n    
 text-decoration: none\;\n    color: #464feb\;\n}\ntr th\, tr td {\n    
 border: 1px solid #e6e6e6\;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: 
 #f5f5f5\;\n}\n\n \n\nThis session will walk you through publishing: from 
 draft to manuscript\, giving you the insight and encouragement you need to 
 move your work forward. It’s crafted for aspiring\, emerging\, and 
 curious writers who want an honest look at publishing\, pitching\, building 
 a platform\, and shaping a vibrant writing life. Come ready to learn\, get 
 inspired\, and take confident steps toward seeing your words in the 
 world.\n\n
LOCATION:East Meeting Room\, East Regional Library (211 Lick Creek Lane)
ORGANIZER;CN="Ciera Williams":MAILTO:cbwilliams@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Author Visit, Writing
