 Learning Lab is a weekly program that offers engaging enrichment lessons 
 created just for homeschoolers.  Come join us each week to learn\, 
 explore\, and connect with other homeschooling families in Durham. \n\nFor 
 any questions regarding kit pickup or accommodation needs\, please reach 
