 least three (3) business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide 
 the best accommodations possible!\n\nProgram details: \n\nDate: Thursday\, 
 June 25\, 2026 \n\nTime: 10a.m.\n\nLocation: North Regional 
 Library\n\nAddress: 221 Milton Rd. Durham\, NC 27712. \n\n
