SUMMARY:Explore Lost Worlds with Mad Science!
DESCRIPTION:Mad Science presents their summer reading show\, Explore Lost 
 Worlds: The Science of Archaeology\, Paleontology\, & Dinosaurs at North 
 Regional Library. This program will be held on Thursday\, June 25\, 2026 
 from 2-3p.m. The address for North Regional Library is 221 Milton Rd. 
 Durham\, NC 27712. \n\nOpen a book and reveal a hidden treasure\, from 
 stories to new knowledge! Our Mad Science program sets explorers on an 
 expedition across the ages. They will practice techniques for uncovering 
 the secrets of forgotten worlds and search out creatures long lost in 
 history. There are so many clues that will lead to a great story!\n\nThis 
 program can accommodate up to 55 kids ages 5-11 and their guardian.  Please 
 register each individual attending in your party (e.g.\, guardian and 
 child). Please register below!
LOCATION:North Meeting Room - Full Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Molly Schaefer":MAILTO:mschaefer@dconc.gov
