SUMMARY:Eco Lab Challenge: Water
DESCRIPTION:Join us for the filtration races! Split into teams we will see 
 how water moves through different materials of your choice. Cleanest water 
 wins! We will also see how that same water changes natural materials.\n\n 
 \n\nThis summer you can get hands on with our Eco Lab Challenge series. 
 We'll explore how people and nature changes our environment over time.
