SUMMARY:Book Babies
DESCRIPTION:Please join us on Fridays at 9:45 a.m. for special bonding time 
 with your little one (ages 0-24 months)! At this lapsit-style storytime\, 
 we will spend about 20 minutes engaging in structured learning through 
 bounces\, rhymes\, songs\, and books\, followed by 15-45 minutes of 
 unstructured play and socialization time.\n\nNote: A television is used 
 during the first part of the program to display the words to the songs and 
 rhymes (to support adult engagement)\; there are no moving pictures. \n\nTo 
 celebrate 2026 Summer Reading and its theme\, "Unearth a Story\," we will 
 be focusing on dinosaurs from June 12 - August 7\, 2026.\n\nAll are 
 welcome! If you have any accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, 
 please contact Chelsea at cromero@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests be 
 made at least three (3) business days prior to the event to ensure we can 
 provide the best accommodations possible!\n
