SUMMARY:North Durham Birding Club
DESCRIPTION:Join us as we learn to access The Great Courses through the 
 library while learning about birding! Each month\, we will watch a video 
 from The Great Courses: Birding in North America to practice accessing our 
 online resources. \n\nThen we will discuss what we've learned\, what birds 
 we've IDed\, and other fun birding tips and tricks.\n\nRegistration is not 
 required but will help us plan. \n\nThis program is graciously sponsored by 
 the Friends of the Durham Library.
