SUMMARY:Roar & Score Bingo
DESCRIPTION:\nGather the whole herd for a prehistoric evening of family fun 
 at Roar & Score Bingo! Families of all ages are invited to enjoy multiple 
 rounds of dinosaur-themed bingo\, win a prize\, and test their luck while 
 surrounded by roaring good times. Whether you’re a T-Rex trivia expert or 
 just love a good game night\, this program is perfect for kids\, 
 caregivers\, and dinosaur fans alike. Come stomp\, roar\, and shout 
 “BINGO!” during this dino-mite adventure at the library! All ages are 
 welcome!\n\nThis program will be held on June 19\, 2026\, at 4:00 p.m. at 
 North Regional Library. The address is 221 Milton Rd. Durham\, NC 27712. 
 \n\nIf you have any accessibility questions or accommodation needs\, please 
 contact us at cromero@dconc.gov. We ask that all requests be made at least 
 three (3) business days prior to the event to ensure we can provide the 
 best accommodations possible!\n
