SUMMARY:Intermediate Spanish Book Club
DESCRIPTION:Join us at our new Intermediate Spanish Book Club! We offer a 
 welcoming space for readers at the A2/B1 Spanish level who want to improve 
 their language skills through engaging literature and conversation. Our 
 current book is "La Casa en Mango Street" by Sandra Cisneros. \n\nReading 
