 literature.\n\n· Anyone who enjoys thoughtful discussion in a supportive 
 environment.\n\nRegistration is required. Please register for each meeting 
 you plan to attend\n\nQuestions? Please contact Jessica at 
 jllundin@dconc.gov or group facilitator Renee Carroll at 
