SUMMARY:Virtual Homeschool Learning Lab: Fizzy Dinosaur Eggs
DESCRIPTION:ROARRR into science! Discover chemical reactions with a 
 hands-on sensory STEM activity. Learn about acids and bases while creating 
 your own dinosaur eggs. \n\n. This activity will include ingredients such 
 as baking soda and vinegar. Please wear clothes you don't mind getting 
 messy. \n\n Virtual Homeschool Learning Lab is a weekly program that offers 
 engaging enrichment lessons created just for homeschoolers via Zoom. Come 
 join us each week to learn\, explore\, and connect with other homeschooling 
 families in Durham. A supply kit will be provided for the program.\n\nFor 
 any questions regarding kit pickup or accommodation needs\, please reach 
 out to Molly at mschaefer@dconc.gov.\n\nProgram details: \n\nDate: Monday\, 
 June 29\, 2026\n\nTime: 2p.m. \n\nLocation: Zoom \n\n \n\n
