BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260629T220000Z
DTEND:20260629T230000Z
DTSTAMP:20260629T000000Z
SUMMARY:AI for the People: Everyday AI Made Simple
DESCRIPTION:A Beginner-Friendly Workshop Hosted by Durham County Public 
 Library & Give It To The People®\n\n \n\nYou've heard about AI. You might 
 even be a little curious — or a little intimidated. This workshop is for 
 you.\n\nAI for the People is a free\, hands-on workshop designed for 
 everyday people who want to use artificial intelligence to simplify their 
 lives\, save time\, and get more done — no tech background 
 required.\n\nWhether you're managing a household\, running a small 
 business\, freelancing on the side\, or just tired of feeling like AI is 
 "not for you\," this session will show you that it absolutely is.\n\nThis 
 is a judgment-free zone. We move at a pace that works for beginners\, and 
 every question is a good question.\n\n📱💻 Bring your laptop and/or 
 cell phone — we'll be working live and hands-on\, so you can practice in 
 real time and leave with skills you've already tried.\n\n \n\nWhat You'll 
 Walk Away With:\n\n✅ A clear\, no-jargon understanding of what AI 
 actually is and how it works \n\n✅ Practical tools you can start using 
 today — from planning and writing to organizing and problem-solving 
 \n\n✅ Entrepreneur-friendly tips for using AI to lighten your workload\, 
 sharpen your marketing\, and free up your time \n\n✅ Real confidence that 
 YOU can use AI — right now\, with what you already have\n\n \n\nREGISTER 
 FOR THIS WORKSHOP HERE: AI for the People: · Luma
LOCATION:North Meeting Room - Full Room\, North Regional Library (221 Milton Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Kathleen Hayes":MAILTO:khayes@dconc.gov
