DESCRIPTION:Unearth a Story with this Summer Reading program for adults! 
 \n\nDo you love diamond painting? Do you also love dinosaurs? Would you 
 love to learn more about dinosaurs while diamond painting dinosaurs? If 
 so\, you're in luck! Join us to watch the North Carolina Museum of 
 Science's recording of "Science Cafe: Rhino's\, Red Pandas\, and Hell 
 Pigs\, Oh My!" while we diamond paint dinosaur figurines! \n\nAll 
 supplies\, including coffee and tea\, will be provided. \n\nRegistration is 
 required\, as supplies are limited. We will meet in the small meeting room 
 of the North Regional Library\, 221 Milton Rd.
