DTSTAMP:20260702T000000Z
SUMMARY:Playtime Pals
DESCRIPTION:Drop in for free play on Thursday mornings from 11 am- noon. 
 Come socialize with other caregivers while your kiddos play!
LOCATION:East Regional - Children's Programming Room\, East Regional Library (211 Lick Creek Lane)
ORGANIZER;CN="Diamond Bethea":MAILTO:dbethea@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Announcements
