BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20260702T180000Z
DTEND:20260702T203000Z
DTSTAMP:20260702T000000Z
SUMMARY:Jurassic Park & Dinosaur Toy Time!!
DESCRIPTION:“God creates dinosaurs. God destroys dinosaurs. God creates 
 man. Man destroys God. Man creates dinosaurs.”   -  Dr Ian Malcolm 
 (Jurassic Park\, 1993)\n\n \n\nJoin us as we celebrate our dino-themed 
 summer reading season with a screening of one of the greatest blockbusters 
 of all time\, Steven Spielberg's Jurassic Park. Come hang out in the 
 children's programming room for a great movie and some dino toy play-time. 
 We will have plenty of toys of all shapes and sizes! \n\n \n\nRated PG-13 
 for sequences of terror and mild language
LOCATION:Main Children's Programming Room\, Main Library (300 N. Roxboro St)
ORGANIZER;CN="Miles Simpson-Quigley":MAILTO:msquigley@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Movie, Summer Reading
