SUMMARY:Explore Lost Worlds with Mad Science!
DESCRIPTION:Mad Science presents their summer reading show\, Explore Lost 
 Worlds: The Science of Archaeology\, Paleontology\, & Dinosaurs! \n\nOpen a 
 book and reveal a hidden treasure\, from stories to new knowledge! Our Mad 
 Science program sets explorers on an expedition across the ages. They will 
 practice techniques for uncovering the secrets of forgotten worlds and 
 search out creatures long lost in history. There are so many clues that 
 will lead to a great story!\n\nThis program can accommodate up to 55 kids 
 ages 5-11. Please register below!
LOCATION:South Meeting Room\, South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Ché A.":MAILTO:tanderson@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Friends of the Durham Library, Summer Reading
