SUMMARY:Movie Mondays - Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse (2018)
DESCRIPTION:Do you like watching movies? Join us @ Southwest Regional for 
 MOVIE MONDAYS!\n\nEvery Monday this summer\, we will be screening an 
 awesome movie for families to enjoy watching together! This week\, we will 
 be watching Spider-Man: Into the Spider-Verse (2018). Snacks will be 
 provided\, too!\n\nRegistration is appreciated\, but it is not 
 required.\n\nIf you have any questions\, please contact us @ 
 919-560-8592.\n\n2026 Summer Reading is made possible thanks to the 
 generous support of the Durham Library Foundation and the Friends of the 
 Durham Library.
