DTSTART:20260706T220000Z
DTEND:20260706T233000Z
DTSTAMP:20260706T000000Z
SUMMARY:Down South Shuffle presents Line Dancing with Nykki
DESCRIPTION:A perfect combination of fun and fitness! Great for beginners\, 
 this class introduces students to basic dance steps and choreography while 
 moving to a variety of music.\n\nRegistration is not required. For more 
 information call the Southwest Regional Library Information Desk at 
 919.560.8593.
LOCATION:Southwest Meeting Room\, Southwest Regional Library (3605 Shannon Rd)
ORGANIZER;CN="Carmen Ruth":MAILTO:cruth@dconc.gov
CATEGORIES:Community Engagement, Health & Fitness
UID:LibCal-14288-16716554
