SUMMARY:Sew Summer: Pool Time!
DESCRIPTION:Join us for three days of sewing fun this summer. All materials 
 will be provided! You can bring your own fabric if you prefer. Experienced 
 sewers will have the opportunity to make up to three projects. We will make 
 a beach towel backpack\, a pool tote bag\, and a pillow. New and less 
 experience sewers are welcome and will begin with the basics\, before 
 choosing from one of the larger projects listed. \n\nThis is a series of 
 classes over three days and we are hoping participants will attend for all 
 three days as projects may overlap days.\n\nPlease feel free to bring a 
 bagged lunch\, drink\, and/or snack. Light refreshments\, such as chips\, 
 will be provided.\n\nFor teens and tweens\, ages 9 and up! Registration is 
 required!
LOCATION:South Regional - Children's Programming Room\, South Regional Library (4505 S. Alston Ave)
ORGANIZER;CN="Ezra L.":MAILTO:eletson@dconc.gov
